  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Wave Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/DrManhattanFloating_article_story_main.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171230175831\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DrManhattanFloating article story main\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/DrManhattanFloating_article_story_main.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171230175831\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/DrManhattanFloating_article_story_main.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171230175831 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/DrManhattanFloating_article_story_main.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171230175831 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DrManhattanFloating article story main\" width=\"270\" height=\"187\" data-image-key=\"DrManhattanFloating_article_story_main.jpg\" data-image-name=\"DrManhattanFloating article story main.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Doctor Manhattan (DC/Watchmen)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store an infinite amount of waves in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>store an infinite or nearly infinite amounts of waves in your body</b>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Absorption\" title=\"Wave Absorption\">Wave Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#All\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>All</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Cosmic_Waves\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Cosmic Waves</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Electromagnetic_Waves\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Electromagnetic Waves</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Kinetic_Energy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Kinetic Energy</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Radiation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Radiation</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Analysis_&amp;_Discussions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Analysis &amp; Discussions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Wave_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Wave Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Wave Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Wave Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Wave_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of containing infinite amounts of waves, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Wave_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorbsion</a> - as all things are waves in some way, shape, or form.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Cosmic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Cosmic Absorption\">Absolute Cosmic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption\">Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Heat Absorption\">Absolute Heat Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Kinetic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Kinetic Absorption\">Absolute Kinetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Radiation_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Radiation Absorption\">Absolute Radiation Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Sound_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Sound Absorption\">Absolute Sound Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Capacitor\" title=\"Sound Capacitor\">Sound Capacitor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Energy\" title=\"Adaptive Energy\">Adaptive Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Immunity\" title=\"Radiation Immunity\">Radiation Immunity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Immunity\" title=\"Cosmic Immunity\">Cosmic Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Immunity\" title=\"Electromagnetism Immunity\">Electromagnetism Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Immunity\" title=\"Energy Immunity\">Energy Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Immunity\" title=\"Heat Immunity\">Heat Immunity</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Accumulation\" title=\"Wave Accumulation\">Wave Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Concentration\" title=\"Wave Concentration\">Wave Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Attacks\" title=\"Wave Attacks\">Wave Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Capacitor\" title=\"Wave Capacitor\">Wave Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Conversion\" title=\"Wave Conversion\">Wave Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Energizing\" title=\"Wave Energizing\">Wave Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Empowerment\" title=\"Wave Empowerment\">Wave Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Particle_Vibration\" title=\"Personal Particle Vibration\">Personal Particle Vibration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Light\" title=\"Personal Light\">Personal Light</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Sound\" title=\"Personal Sound\">Personal Sound</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (Limited to wave-based powers)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Wave_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden